  "body": "Wake to spectacular sea views, watch the sunrise over the water, and unwind with stunning sunsets from this impressive three-storey family home.\r\n\r\nGenerously proportioned and thoughtfully designed, the home offers exceptional space and flexibility with five spacious bedrooms, three separate living areas and superb indoor-outdoor flow. Perfect for growing families, teenagers, guests and working from home, there is room for everyone to enjoy their own space.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a beautifully appointed kitchen features quality fixtures and fittings, complemented by stylish bathrooms throughout. Three bedrooms enjoy the luxury of private ensuites and walk-in wardrobes, while two further bedrooms are serviced by a well-appointed family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThree separate living areas provide outstanding versatility, offering space for formal entertaining, relaxed family living, media, children's retreats or quiet downtime. Elevated across three levels, the home captures exceptional sea views, with beautiful sunrises and sunsets creating an ever-changing backdrop. The lifestyle is equally appealing, with a charming village setting, excellent schools, reserves, children's play areas and the beach all within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\nYou'll love:\r\n- Spectacular sea views and stunning sunrises and sunsets\r\n- Spacious three-storey family home\r\n- Five generous bedrooms\r\n- Three bedrooms with ensuites and walk-in wardrobes\r\n- Two further bedrooms with family bathroom\r\n- Three separate living areas\r\n- Quality kitchen and bathroom fixtures and fittings\r\n- Excellent schools nearby\r\n- Village lifestyle with reserves and play areas close by\r\n- Easy walk to the beach\r\n- Exceptional space and flexibility for family living\r\n\r\nA spacious, beautifully appointed home offering spectacular views and an enviable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/XLQV",
